{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sequelize/sequelize/issues/8423","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sequelize/sequelize","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sequelize/sequelize/issues/8423/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sequelize/sequelize/issues/8423/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sequelize/sequelize/issues/8423/events","html_url":"https://github.com/sequelize/sequelize/issues/8423","id":262804671,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUyNjI4MDQ2NzE=","number":8423,"title":"[regression] Operator symbols not enumerable in `for .. in` loops!","user":{"login":"louisremi","id":39374,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5Mzc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39374?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/louisremi","html_url":"https://github.com/louisremi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louisremi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louisremi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louisremi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louisremi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louisremi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louisremi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louisremi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louisremi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louisremi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":8,"created_at":"2017-10-04T14:18:08Z","updated_at":"2018-05-05T08:52:37Z","closed_at":"2018-05-05T08:52:37Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"*EDIT: I initially thought the new *Operator Symbols* introduced in 4.12.0 were only incompatible with `_.isEmpty`. I quickly realized they're incompatible with `for .. in` loops and the implications are far more serious!*\r\n\r\nI've found an important regression that occurred when Operator Symbols were introduced in 4.12.0: every time `_.isEmpty` is used against an object that contains only Symbol keyed props, it returns `true` :-(\r\nIndeed, [isEmpty's documentation](https://lodash.com/docs/4.17.4#isEmpty) states that *\"Objects are considered empty if they have no own enumerable **string** keyed properties.\"* (emphasis is mine).\r\n\r\nThe first important regression I've spotted is when using the paranoid option on a model. The function [`_paranoidClause`](https://github.com/sequelize/sequelize/blob/master/lib/model.js#L52) might override `options.where` because of the incorrect result of [`_.isEmpty(options.where)`](https://github.com/sequelize/sequelize/blob/master/lib/model.js#L86). In my app, where I constantly use this option, many queries were completely messed up.\r\n\r\nOther occurrences of _.isEmtpy might introduce equally severe regressions. I advise we replace them all with a custom implementation of that method.\r\n\r\nI'll try to find some time to write a first PR fixing this in the evening, if no one else does.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"sushantdhiman","id":9989487,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5ODk0ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9989487?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantdhiman","html_url":"https://github.com/sushantdhiman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantdhiman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantdhiman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantdhiman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantdhiman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantdhiman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantdhiman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantdhiman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantdhiman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantdhiman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sequelize/sequelize/issues/8423/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sequelize/sequelize/issues/8423/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}